Special Features:
1.	 The game progresses through 3 levels.
2.	Each level increases:
3.	Enemy count
4.	Enemy speed
5.	Difficulty
6.	After completing all levels, the player wins the game.
7.	Players have 3 lives.
8.	Colliding with an enemy reduces one life.
9.	When lives reach zero “ Game Over” and restart from Level 1.
10.	Player earns points by shooting enemies/debris.
11.	Different colored enemies give different scores.
12.	Score threshold (Level × 1000) unlocks the next level.
